&lt;li&gt;As the employee&amp;nbsp;lifecycle continues, you will ensure employees receive a positive pay-day experience every&amp;nbsp;month in addition to providing support and guidance to the management team with ongoing&amp;nbsp;performance management and to the employee as they develop their career with Ebury.&lt;/li&gt;
